.TH ag-integrate 1  "integrate 0.3.0-beta.7"
.SH NAME
ag\-integrate \- Integrate a proposal into its stream
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBag integrate\fR [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-repo\fR] [\fB\-\-key\fR] [\fB\-\-as\fR] [\fB\-\-fencing\-token\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIPROPOSAL\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Integrate a proposal into its stream
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-repo\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Operate on the repository at this path (default: discovered from the current directory)
.TP
\fB\-\-key\fR \fI<KEY>\fR
Idempotency key (default: derived from the proposal; repeating resumes/replays). Not the issuer key of `ag validate run \-\-key`; `\-\-idempotency\-key` is the unambiguous spelling
.TP
\fB\-\-as\fR \fI<IDENTITY>\fR
Act as this identity (`user:alice`, `agent:bot#run_…`, `service:ci`). Also: AG_IDENTITY
.TP
\fB\-\-fencing\-token\fR \fI<FENCING_TOKENS>\fR
Fencing token(s) of exclusive leases the author holds
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON output
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR
Colour the output: auto (a terminal, unless NO_COLOR is set), always or never
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print only what was asked for: no confirmations or hints. Errors and refusals are still shown
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Explain what is happening on standard error: repository, identity, remote, timing
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIPROPOSAL\fR>
Proposal id
.SH EXTRA
Exit codes: 0 integrated, 3 blocked (provide what is missing and run it again), 4 conflict, denied or invalid.
The stream is untouched unless the exit code is 0. Examples:
  ag integrate prop_8f3a1c                        any unique id prefix works
  ag integrate prop_8f3a1c \-\-fencing\-token 7      present the token of your exclusive lease
  ag \-\-json integrate prop_8f3a1c                 stable blocker codes for scripts and agents
.SH VERSION
v0.3.0\-beta.7
